{%- comment -%}
  Hartwick Atelier — copy with Yoga hidden (29 September 2026, Ivan: "hide all
  yoga-related parts … don't remove them").

  Prints `text` as written while Theme settings > Show Yoga is on. While it is
  off, the one phrase that names yoga in the range list is read without it:
  "silk scarves, fine jewellery and yoga mats" → "silk scarves and fine
  jewellery". The setting itself is never edited, so ticking Show Yoga brings
  the original sentence back word for word.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign out = text
  unless settings.ha_show_yoga
    assign out = out | replace: 'silk scarves, fine jewellery and yoga mats', 'silk scarves and fine jewellery'
  endunless
  echo out
-%}
